ght="54" rx="8" fill="#f4efe1" stroke="#7a6a4f"/><text x="16" y="6810" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">48</text><text x="16" y="6824" font-size="10" fill="#222">tricias kitchen</text></a><a href="#room49"><rect x="206" y="6688" width="150" height="54" rx="8" fill="#f4efe1" stroke="#7a6a4f"/><text x="212" y="6702" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">49</text><text x="212" y="6716" font-size="10" fill="#222">tricias bedroom</text></a><text x="10" y="6904" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">Rooms with no walking exits: off stage, the cab, the trains, the police cab, Old Mill Road</text><a href="#room0"><rect x="10" y="6924" width="150" height="54" rx="8" fill="#f4efe1" stroke="#7a6a4f"/><text x="16" y="6938" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">0</text><text x="16" y="6952" font-size="10" fill="#222">(off stage)</text></a><a href="#room1"><rect x="206" y="6924" width="150" height="54" rx="8" fill="#f4efe1" stroke="#7a6a4f"/><text x="212" y="6938" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">1</text><text x="212" y="6952" font-size="10" fill="#222">hansom cab</text></a><a href="#room2"><rect x="402" y="6924" width="150" height="54" rx="8" fill="#f4efe1" stroke="#7a6a4f"/><text x="408" y="6938" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">2</text><text x="408" y="6952" font-size="10" fill="#222">steam train</text></a><a href="#room3"><rect x="598" y="6924" width="150" height="54" rx="8" fill="#f4efe1" stroke="#7a6a4f"/><text x="604" y="6938" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">3</text><text x="604" y="6952" font-size="10" fill="#222">steam train</text></a><a href="#room4"><rect x="794" y="6924" width="150" height="54" rx="8" fill="#f4efe1" stroke="#7a6a4f"/><text x="800" y="6938" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">4</text><text x="800" y="6952" font-size="10" fill="#222">steam train</text></a><a href="#room103"><rect x="990" y="6924" width="150" height="54" rx="8" fill="#f4efe1" stroke="#7a6a4f"/><text x="996" y="6938" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">103</text><text x="996" y="6952" font-size="10" fill="#222">old mill road</text></a><a href="#room105"><rect x="1186" y="6924" width="150" height="54" rx="8" fill="#f4efe1" stroke="#7a6a4f"/><text x="1192" y="6938" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#4a3d26">105</text><text x="1192" y="6952" font-size="10" fill="#222">police cab</text></a></svg></div><p>Room descriptions below are the rooms' own description messages, rendered by the game's interpreter (it prints them in capitals to the renderer; in play they appear in sentence case). Most rooms have none and are described from their name and exits alone.</p><table class="disassembly"><tr><th>#</th><th>Room</th><th>Exits</th><th>Own description</th></tr><tr id="room0"><td>0</td><td>#R$84E1(room 0)</td><td>-</td><td></td></tr><tr id="room1"><td>1</td><td>#R$84EB(hansom cab)</td><td>-</td><td>You are travelling the streets of london in a hansom cab, the sun shines through the windows onto your face.</td></tr><tr id="room2"><td>2</td><td>#R$84F5(steam train)</td><td>-</td><td>You are travelling along the london underground railway in a steam train.</td></tr><tr id="room3"><td>3</td><td>#R$84FF(steam train)</td><td>-</td><td>You are riding in a steam train through the picturesque english countryside.</td></tr><tr id="room4"><td>4</td><td>#R$8509(steam train)</td><td>-</td><td>You are riding in a steam train being shunted between platforms.</td></tr><tr id="room5"><td>5</td><td>#R$8513(baker street)</td><td>north to <a href="#room6">6</a> past front door</td><td></td></tr><tr id="room6"><td>6</td><td>#R$8520(entrance hallway)</td><td>up to <a href="#room7">7</a> past stairway<br>south to <a href="#room5">5</a> past front door</td><td></td></tr><tr id="room7"><td>7</td><td>#R$8530(hall)</td><td>east to <a href="#room8">8</a> past your door<br>down to <a href="#room6">6</a> past stairway</td><td></td></tr><tr id="room8"><td>8</td><td>#R$8540(your room)</td><td>west to <a href="#room7">7</a> past your door<br>north to <a href="#room9">9</a> past plain door</td><td>The sun streams in the two broad windows in your sitting room. there is a pipe rack to the right of the sofa. bullet pock marks are the feature of one wall, and charts and diagrams fill another. an acid stained table sits in the corner.</td></tr><tr id="room9"><td>9</td><td>#R$8550(small closet)</td><td>south to <a href="#room8">8</a> past plain door</td><td></td></tr><tr id="room10"><td>10</td><td>#R$855D(parliament street)</td><td>east to <a href="#room11">11</a></td><td></td></tr><tr id="room11"><td>11</td><td>#R$856A(scotland yard)</td><td>west to <a href="#room10">10</a></td><td></td></tr><tr id="room12"><td>12</td><td>#R$8577(slater street)</td><td>north to <a href="#room13">13</a> past hidden door <em>(too narrow for the player)</em></td><td></td></tr><tr id="room13"><td>13</td><td>#R$8584(disgusting opium den)</td><td>south to <a href="#room12">12</a></td><td></td></tr><tr id="room14"><td>14</td><td>#R$8591(aldergate street)</td><td>northwest to <a href="#room15">15</a></td><td></td></tr><tr id="room15"><td>15</td><td>#R$859E(aldergate station)</td><td>southeast to <a href="#room14">14</a><br>northwest to <a href="#room16">16</a></td><td></td></tr><tr id="room16"><td>16</td><td>#R$85AE(platform one)</td><td>southeast to <a href="#room15">15</a><br>northwest to <a href="#room17">17</a></td><td>You are at platform one of aldergate station.</td></tr><tr id="room17"><td>17</td><td>#R$85BE(platform two)</td><td>southeast to <a href="#room16">16</a></td><td>You are at platform two of aldergate station.</td></tr><tr id="room18"><td>18</td><td>#R$85CB(kings cross road)</td><td>northeast to <a href="#room19">19</a></td><td></td></tr><tr id="room19"><td>19</td><td>#R$85D8(kings cross station)</td><td>southwest to <a href="#room18">18</a><br>northeast to <a href="#room20">20</a></td><td></td></tr><tr id="room20"><td>20</td><td>#R$85E8(pl