<p>Every entry in the entity index at #R$8B6F, decoded by objects.py. Ids 0-13 are the characters (0 is you). Size is record byte +2: how big a thing is, and for a container how much it holds (#R$DEE4); for passages it is how big an actor may be to get through (#R$DD35). "Starts" is the state in the file, before play.</p><p>Flag bytes (added 2026-11-07). +5: bit 0 locked, bit 2 full, bit 4 on (lit), bit 5 open, bit 6 alive (a person), bit 7 revealed - named by the words in #R$C471 and #R$C481, which the game prints when an action needs one of them; bits 5 and 7 confirmed by play. +6: bit 7 the player has seen it, bit 6 the player has examined it (confirmed: EXAMINE LAMP turns $80 into $C0); these are what the evidence in the case table at #R$9965 tests.</p><table class="disassembly"><tr><th>Id</th><th>Name</th><th>Starts</th><th>Size</th><th>Its own actions</th></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>#R$8CBA(you)</td><td><a href="map.html#room8">8</a> your room</td><td>96</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>#R$8CCB(china man)</td><td>off stage (room 0)</td><td>80</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>#R$8CDC(inspector lestrade)</td><td><a href="map.html#room11">11</a> scotland yard</td><td>32</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>#R$8CED(watson)</td><td>in/on/with watsons armchair</td><td>96</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>#R$8CFE(chief constable straker)</td><td><a href="map.html#room53">53</a> leatherhead station</td><td>64</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>#R$8D0F(strachan)</td><td><a href="map.html#room67">67</a> sitting room</td><td>8</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>#R$8D20(phipps)</td><td><a href="map.html#room67">67</a> sitting room</td><td>21</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>#R$8D31(major percival ffoulkes)</td><td>off stage (room 0)</td><td>64</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>#R$8D42(gardener)</td><td><a href="map.html#room65">65</a> large kitchen</td><td>21</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>#R$8D53(cook)</td><td><a href="map.html#room65">65</a> large