></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>163</td><td><code>NORTHEAST</code></td><td>Tue 1:26am</td><td>Platform Two</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>164</td><td><code>NORTHEAST</code></td><td>Tue 1:28am</td><td>Platform Three</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>165</td><td><code>NORTHEAST</code></td><td>Tue 1:30am</td><td>Platform Four</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr></table></div><h3 id="walk15">15. Wait for the 7:30am train; to Leatherhead</h3><p><small>Steps 166-172, Tue 1:30am to Tue 9:04am.</small> WAIT through the night until the steam train enters at 7:30am, climb in at 7:32 and ride to Leather Head platform one (9:00am). Climb out.</p><div class="tablewrap"><table class="steps"><tr><th>Step</th><th>Type</th><th>Clock after</th><th>Where</th><th>The game replies</th><th>Without this line</th></tr><tr><td>166</td><td><code>LOOK</code> &times;1 <small>(repeated until the reply shows &ldquo;steam&rdquo;)</small></td><td>Tue 1:31am</td><td>Platform Four</td><td>You are at platform four of Kings cross station. Visible exits are southwest. You can see Watson and a steam train. Watson is carrying the daily chronicle.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>167</td><td><code>WAIT</code> &times;64 <small>(repeated until the reply shows &ldquo;Tue 06:5&rdquo;)</small></td><td>Tue 6:51am</td><td>Platform Four</td><td>You wait.</td><td>still wins</td></tr><tr><td>168</td><td><code>WAIT</code> &times;6 <small>(repeated until the reply shows &ldquo;Tue 07:2&rdquo;)</small></td><td>Tue 7:21am</td><td>Platform Four</td><td>You wait.</td><td>still wins</td></tr><tr><td>169</td><td><code>LOOK</code> &times;9 <small>(repeated until the reply shows &ldquo;steam&rdquo;)</small></td><td>Tue 7:30am</td><td>Platform Four</td><td>You are at platform four of Kings cross station. Visible exits are southwest. You can see Watson. Watson is carrying the daily chronicle. A steam train enters.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>170</td><td><code>CLIMB INTO TRAIN</code></td><td>Tue 7:32am</td><td>Platform Four</td><td>You climb into the steam train. Watson climbs into the steam train.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>171</td><td><code>WAIT</code> &times;18 <small>(repeated until the reply shows &ldquo;Leather&rdquo;)</small></td><td>Tue 9:00am</td><td>Platform One</td><td>You wait. You are in a steam train with Inspector Lestrade and Watson. Inspector Lestrade is carrying some money. Watson is carrying the daily chronicle. You are at platform one of Leather Head station. Visible exits are south ...</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>172</td><td><code>CLIMB OUT</code></td><td>Tue 9:04am</td><td>Platform One</td><td>You climb out of the steam train. Inspector Lestrade goes south. Watson climbs out of the steam train.</td><td>loses</td></tr></table></div><h3 id="walk16">16. The bridge again: the gun in the stream</h3><p><small>Steps 173-186, Tue 9:04am to Tue 9:35am.</small> The same garden route to the east side of the bridge (9:20am). EXAMINE CLOSELY DEEP STREAM: Lestrade finds a gun tied to a large rock. Then back to the main street.</p><div class="tablewrap"><table class="steps"><tr><th>Step</th><th>Type</th><th>Clock after</th><th>Where</th><th>The game replies</th><th>Without this line</th></tr><tr><td>173</td><td><code>SOUTH</code></td><td>Tue 9:04am</td><td>Leatherhead Station</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>174</td><td><code>SOUTH</code></td><td>Tue 9:08am</td><td>Main Street</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>175</td><td><code>WEST</code></td><td>Tue 9:10am</td><td>Browns Front Gate</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>176</td><td><code>SOUTH</code></td><td>Tue 9:12am</td><td>Garden Path</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>177</td><td><code>SOUTHWEST</code></td><td>Tue 9:14am</td><td>Winding Garden Path</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>178</td><td><code>SOUTH</code></td><td>Tue 9:16am</td><td>Winding Garden Path</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>179</td><td><code>SOUTHWEST</code></td><td>Tue 9:18am</td><td>West Side</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>180</td><td><code>EAST</code></td><td>Tue 9:20am</td><td>East Side</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>181</td><td><code>EXAMINE CLOSELY DEEP STREAM</code></td><td>Tue 9:25am</td><td>East Side</td><td>You closely examine the deep stream. As you search the river Lestrade comes over to help. He stumbles and slides down the bank and notices a gleam in the water. Reaching in he pulls out a gun tied to a large rock and exclaims &quot; ...</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>182</td><td><code>WEST</code></td><td>Tue 9:27am</td><td>West Side</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>183</td><td><code>NORTH</code></td><td>Tue 9:29am</td><td>Winding Garden Path</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>184</td><td><code>NORTH</code></td><td>Tue 9:31am</td><td>Winding Garden Path</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>185</td><td><code>NORTHEAST</code></td><td>Tue 9:33am</td><td>Garden Path</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>186</td><td><code>NORTH</code></td><td>Tue 9:35am</td><td>Browns Front Gate</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr></table></div><h3 id="walk17">17. Basil&#x27;s house at Cobden Lane: the wall safe</h3><p><small>Steps 187-205, Tue 9:35am to Tue 10:23am.</small> OPEN FRONT DOOR, the sitting room, to Basils Library. OPEN WALL SAFE (it takes 15 minutes), TAKE and EXAMINE CLOSELY the letters (blackmail letters to Mrs Brown from Tricia). Back out and to Leather Head platform two (10:23am).</p><div class="tablewrap"><table class="steps"><tr><th>Step</th><th>Type</th><th>Clock after</th><th>Where</th><th>The game replies</th><th>Without this line</th></tr><tr><td>187</td><td><code>EAST</code></td><td>Tue 9:37am</td><td>Main Street</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>188</td><td><code>SOUTH</code></td><td>Tue 9:39am</td><td>Cobden Lane</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>189</td><td><code>OPEN FRONT DOOR</code></td><td>Tue 9:39am</td><td>Cobden Lane</td><td>(already open) THE FRONT DOOR IS OPEN</td><td>still wins</td></tr><tr><td>190</td><td><code>EAST</code></td><td>Tue 9:41am</td><td>Entrance Hall</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>191</td><td><code>OPEN SITTINGROOM DOOR</code></td><td>Tue 9:41am</td><td>Entrance Hall</td><td>(already open) THE SITTINGROOM DOOR IS OPEN</td><td>still wins</td></tr><tr><td>192</td><td><code>EAST</code></td><td>Tue 9:43am</td><td>Lounge Room</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>193</td><td><code>SOUTH</code></td><td>Tue 9:45am</td><td>Basils Library</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>194</td><td><code>OPEN WALL SAFE</code></td><td>Tue 10:01am</td><td>Basils Library</td><td>You open the wall safe.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>195</td><td><code>TAKE LETTERS</code></td><td>Tue 10:02am</td><td>Basils Library</td><td>You take some letters.</td><td>still wins</td></tr><tr><td>196</td><td><code>EXAMINE CLOSELY LETTERS</code></td><td>Tue 10:07am</td><td>Basils Library</td><td>You closely examine some letters. They are to Mrs Brown from Tricia and appear to be blackmail letters.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>197</td><td><code>NORTH</code></td><td>Tue 10:09am</td><td>Lounge Room</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>198</td><td><code>OPEN SITTINGROOM DOOR</code></td><td>Tue 10:10am</td><td>Lounge Room</td><td>You open the sittingroom door.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>199</td><td><code>WEST</code></td><td>Tue 10:12am</td><td>Entrance Hall</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>200</td><td><code>OPEN FRONT DOOR</code></td><td>Tue 10:13am</td><td>Entrance Hall</td><td>You open the front door. Watson enters. Watson says to you &quot; Good morning &quot; .</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>201</td><td><code>WEST</code></td><td>Tue 10:15am</td><td>Cobden Lane</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>202</td><td><code>NORTH</code></td><td>Tue 10:17am</td><td>Main Street</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>203</td><td><code>NORTH</code></td><td>Tue 10:19am</td><td>Leatherhead Station</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>204</td><td><code>NORTH</code></td>