:23pm</td><td>Passage</td><td>(already open) THE PLAIN DOOR IS OPEN</td><td>still wins</td></tr><tr><td>283</td><td><code>NORTHEAST</code></td><td>Tue 10:25pm</td><td>Basils Kitchen</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>284</td><td><code>OPEN BACK DOOR</code></td><td>Tue 10:26pm</td><td>Basils Kitchen</td><td>You open the back door.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>285</td><td><code>NORTHEAST</code></td><td>Tue 10:28pm</td><td>Basils Yard</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>286</td><td><code>EXAMINE CLOSELY TRASH PILE</code></td><td>Tue 10:33pm</td><td>Basils Yard</td><td>You closely examine the trash pile. You see a trash pile.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>287</td><td><code>TAKE TORN CODED NOTE</code></td><td>Tue 10:34pm</td><td>Basils Yard</td><td>You take the torn coded note.</td><td>still wins</td></tr><tr><td>288</td><td><code>EXAMINE CLOSELY TORN CODED NOTE</code></td><td>Tue 10:39pm</td><td>Basils Yard</td><td>You closely examine the torn coded note. VAKS USH KNWH UL UNMH YWNQH. UNMH QNTH FTK RTLVBK GHNUS SNK KUNTUHG USH YLWAQH BLKABP NTLEBG. Rnkaw.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>289</td><td><code>WEAR CHINA MANS DISGUISE</code></td><td>Tue 10:40pm</td><td>in disguise</td><td>You wear the china mans disguise.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>290</td><td><code>SOUTHWEST</code></td><td>Tue 10:42pm</td><td>in disguise</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>291</td><td><code>SOUTHWEST</code></td><td>Tue 10:44pm</td><td>in disguise</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>292</td><td><code>SOUTHWEST</code></td><td>Tue 10:46pm</td><td>in disguise</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>293</td><td><code>SOUTHEAST</code></td><td>Tue 10:48pm</td><td>in disguise</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>294</td><td><code>SOUTHWEST</code></td><td>Tue 10:50pm</td><td>in disguise</td><td></td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>295</td><td><code>TAKE OFF CHINA MANS DISGUISE</code></td><td>Tue 10:51pm</td><td>Basils Front Yard</td><td>The china man takes off the china mans disguise. Watson says to you &quot; Hello &quot;.</td><td>loses</td></tr></table></div><h3 id="walk25">25. Wednesday morning: wait outside</h3><p><small>Steps 296-304, Tue 10:51pm to Wed 10:06am.</small> WAIT through the night to 9:41am, then LOOK up to 10:06am. You stay in the front yard; the earlier notes say Phipps shoots anyone in the bedroom at 9:50am and leaves at 10:06.</p><div class="tablewrap"><table class="steps"><tr><th>Step</th><th>Type</th><th>Clock after</th><th>Where</th><th>The game replies</th><th>Without this line</th></tr><tr><td>296</td><td><code>WAIT</code> &times;80 <small>(repeated until the reply shows &ldquo;Wed 06:5&rdquo;)</small></td><td>Wed 5:31am</td><td>Basils Front Yard</td><td>You wait.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>297</td><td><code>WAIT</code> &times;50 <small>(repeated until the reply shows &ldquo;Wed 09:4&rdquo;)</small></td><td>Wed 9:41am</td><td>Basils Front Yard</td><td>You wait.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>298</td><td><code>LOOK</code> &times;19 <small>(repeated until the reply shows &ldquo;Wed 10:0&rdquo;)</small></td><td>Wed 10:00am</td><td>Basils Front Yard</td><td>You are in Basils Front Yard. To the northeast there is the window. Visible exits are west. You can see Watson. Watson is carrying the daily chronicle.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>299</td><td><code>LOOK</code></td><td>Wed 10:01am</td><td>Basils Front Yard</td><td>You are in Basils Front Yard. To the northeast there is the window. Visible exits are west. You can see Watson. Watson is carrying the daily chronicle.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>300</td><td><code>LOOK</code></td><td>Wed 10:02am</td><td>Basils Front Yard</td><td>You are in Basils Front Yard. To the northeast there is the window. Visible exits are west. You can see Watson. Watson is carrying the daily chronicle.</td><td>loses</td></tr><tr><td>301</td><td><code>LOOK</code></td><td>Wed 10:03am</td><td>Basils Front Yard</td><td>You are in Basils Front Yard. To the northeast there is the window. Visibl